            "url": "https://hugohalle.com/video-ghastlies/",
            "title": "Dead Format",
            "summary": "Key Art for the upcoming horror game Dead Format. Indie Publisher ORO Interactive approached me to help them create the key art for the exciting&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"project-text formatted-text container-sm\">\n<p>Key Art for the upcoming horror game Dead Format.</p>\n<div class=\"project-description\">\n<p>Indie Publisher <a href=\"https://www.orointeractive.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ORO Interactive</a> approached me to help them create the key art for the exciting horror title Video Ghastlies. <br>Their pitch was to produce an image evocative of the 80s horror-film VHS covers. Hard to say no to that.</p>\n<p>Beside the main artwork, I also delivered the variations designed to be integrated in Steam.</p>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"post__image post__image--wide\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hugohalle.com/media/posts/38/hugo-halle-steamstore-assetshowcase-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" srcset=\"https://hugohalle.com/media/posts/38/responsive/hugo-halle-steamstore-assetshowcase-2-xs.jpg 300w ,https://hugohalle.com/media/posts/38/responsive/hugo-halle-steamstore-assetshowcase-2-sm.jpg 480w ,https://hugohalle.com/media/posts/38/responsive/hugo-halle-steamstore-assetshowcase-2-md.jpg 749w ,https://hugohalle.com/media/posts/38/responsive/hugo-halle-steamstore-assetshowcase-2-xl.jpg 1200w ,https://hugohalle.com/media/posts/38/responsive/hugo-halle-steamstore-assetshowcase-2-xxl.jpg 1600w ,https://hugohalle.com/media/posts/38/responsive/hugo-halle-steamstore-assetshowcase-2-xxxl.jpg 2560w\">\n<figcaption>Steam Page Assets</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>",
            "image": "https://hugohalle.com/media/posts/38/VideoGhastlies_KeyArt_1440_16x9_NoLogo.jpg",
